        2. Universal Knowledge Vault (Wiki + OpenAlex)
      </button>
      <button onclick="switchTab('platforms')" data-tab="platforms" class="nav-tab px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-carddark whitespace-nowrap">
        3. 25+ Connected Learning Platforms
      </button>
